# One chord keeps the Mac awake. The cup in the menu bar says so, its menu holds
# the rest, and the same chord lets it sleep again.
clock 10:12 · battery 72 · power ac · floor 15

key
caption "⌃⌥⌘A starts your session. The cup fills and burns: even a closed lid won't sleep the Mac."
open menu
caption "The menu says who is holding the Mac awake, and for how long."
hover "Battery floor"
caption "A battery floor ends every claim before the charge runs out."
close menu

key
caption "The same chord ends your session, and the Mac sleeps as usual."
